---
// src/components/landing/Features.astro
---

<section class="relative mb-80">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-0">
    <div class="lg:col-span-8">
      <span
        class="font-mono text-primary text-[10px] tracking-[0.6em] uppercase mb-12 block opacity-50"
        >// CORE_FEATURES</span
      >
      <h2
        class="font-headline text-[clamp(4rem,12vw,10rem)] font-bold tracking-tighter leading-[0.85] uppercase mb-12 text-on-surface"
      >
        Your Mind<br />Is Not A<br /><span class="text-primary/10"
          >Hard Drive.</span
        >
      </h2>
      <p
        class="font-mono text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant/40 leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-[0.4em] max-w-sm mb-32"
      >
        Biological hardware is limited by linear attention. Digital software
        must adapt.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-12 relative h-150">
      <div
        class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-full lg:w-[45%] glass-panel p-16 rounded-3xl instrument-glow z-20 translate-y-[-20%] hover:-translate-y-[22%] hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(186,158,255,0.1)] transition-all duration-500"
      >
        <span
          class="font-mono text-primary text-[10px] bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-8 inline-block"
          >FEATURE_01</span
        >
        <h3 class="font-headline text-5xl font-bold mb-8 text-on-surface">
          Command Center
        </h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-xl leading-relaxed font-light">
          Modern interfaces are built for storage, not synthesis. We provide a
          space for the messy, non-linear reality of human creativity.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute top-75 left-0 lg:left-[10%] w-full lg:w-[45%] glass-panel p-16 rounded-3xl instrument-glow z-10 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(186,158,255,0.1)] transition-all duration-500"
      >
        <span
          class="font-mono text-secondary text-[10px] bg-secondary/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-8 inline-block"
          >FEATURE_02</span
        >
        <h3 class="font-headline text-5xl font-bold mb-8 text-secondary">
          Knowledge Layer
        </h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-xl leading-relaxed font-light">
          Every open mental tab is a drain on your cognitive bandwidth. TajsOS
          acts as an external pre-frontal cortex.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
